<title>USA: Just For Feet postpones $100 mln placement.</title>
<headline>Just For Feet postpones $100 mln placement.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Just For Feet Inc said Monday it has postponed its previously announced private placement of $100 million of Convertible Subordinated Notes due 2004 because  under Alabama law it is required to obtain shareholder approval to issue the debt.</p>
<p>The company said it expects to obtain the required shareholder approval and recommence the private placement at a later date.</p>
</text>
